  Mamba achieves state-of-the-art results on the synthetic tasks ([REF:sec:exp:synthetic]) and three different domains (language, DNA, audio) ([REF:sec:exp:language,sec:exp:genomics,sec:exp:audio]) on both pretraining and downstream tasks,
  while being very computationally efficient ([REF:sec:exp:benchmark]).
}

\subsection{Synthetic Tasks}

